# Blog content rules

## Format
- Posts are **HTML** (`public/content/posts/<slug>.html`), not Markdown.
- Index: `public/content/posts/index.json` (`draft?`, `cover`, `tags`, `readingTime`, optional `youtubeUrl`, etc.).
- Images live in `public/assets/blog/<slug>/`; HTML `src` uses `assets/blog/...`.
- Listing cards without covers use `assets/blog/placeholder.svg` so card height stays consistent.

## Draft visibility
- `draft: true` → hidden from lists/home/categories.
- Direct `/blog/:slug` must still resolve drafts.
- To publish: remove `draft` or set `false`, then redeploy.

## BlogService / detail page
- Load `.html` (no `marked`).
- Filter drafts in `getPosts` / categories; `getPost(slug)` includes drafts.
- Cover shows in post header; strip matching duplicate cover image from body HTML before render.
- Optional `youtubeUrl` (watch/share link) replaces the cover on the detail page when present (embed only — no image + video stack).

## Migration
- Reusable script: `node scripts/migrate-blogger-posts.js`
- Skip empty stubs / junk; ignore old Blogger labels; assign sensible site categories.
